      "id": "2044889199963250752",
      "text": "I dont get into streamer drama, so let me just say this:\n\nThis subtle victim playing is tip #1 on how to spot a misogynyst.\n\n\"I wish I had a choice in this being made public :(\" \"it's getting in the way of us healing :(\"\n\nGuess who speaking up benefits? The victims. As it should. \n\nDont fall for the misogynistic playbook of painting the man as the victim of his predation.",
